  "title": "Staying connected with customers in the age of big data",
  "summary": "The owner of a large supermarket chain approached CGI with how difficult it is to retain customers and attract new ones, especially in their large urban and suburban stores. He felt they were losing sight of their loyal customers and what makes them stay or go. Back when they were a small, local grocer, they knew their customers personally—their likes, dislikes and family members.",
